  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#input-type-attr-summary\r\n\r\nInput types `text`, `search`, `tel`, `url`, and `password` allow those selection properties but not `email`\r\n\r\nWhy is that? If it's because `email` supports the `multiple` attribute then could `selectionStart` and `selectionEnd` be supported when the `multiple` attribute is not used?",
